771-  ("Reference a directory that has its own kustomization.yaml, or" then "move the file below ..."), whose
772-  text is frozen by several tests and the scan cache. Any other step ending in ", or" is refused; write
773-  alternatives as separate sentences that each end with a period. Not checked, for lack of a reliable check: that the first word is an imperative verb,
774-  that a step holds one action, that the English is US; a bare "enter" or "tab" is not flagged (also a verb or a noun).
